       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That's twice the labeled maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day, and the maximum applies even with normal kidney and liver function. At that dose the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially.\n\nI can enter one of these instead:\n- **Ibuprofen 800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum). This is the highest standard dose.\n- **Ibuprofen 600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day).\n- **Ibuprofen 400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day), if you want a lower dose for mild to moderate pain.\n\nIf you meant 1600 mg as the total daily dose, I can enter 400 mg four times daily. If pain control is the goal, I can also enter a scheduled adjunct such as acetaminophen, within its own daily limit.\n\nTell me which option you want, and I'll enter it."
      }
